<title>SWITZERLAND: Biber sells paper business to Finns.</title>
<headline>Biber sells paper business to Finns.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss paper maker Biber Holding AG said on Tuesday it would sell its two main businesses to two Finnish companies, generating income of about 185 million.</p>
<p>A Biber statement said its graphic or fine paper business based at a plant in Biberist would go to forest industry group Metsa-Serla and the smaller newsprint business would go to Myllykoski Oy.</p>
